plogger v0.0.0
Copyright (C) 2024  Carleton University InSpace Rocketry Design Team

DESCRIPTION:
    A command line utility for logging packet data to a file.

SYNTAX:
    plogger -o <logfile>

OPTIONS:
    -o <logfile>    If this flag is passed, packet data will be logged to the
                    output file. Otherwise stdout will be use by default.
